          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "CPU Utilisation",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Share of the host's CPU used by SQL Server and by other processes, per target, from the scheduler monitor ring buffer. SQL Server writes one record a minute, so values step once a minute and show the average of the previous minute. Other processes are shown for Windows hosts only: SQL Server on Linux does not report idle time."
    },
