          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Buffer Cache Hit Ratio",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Share of page requests served from memory without a disk read. Healthy OLTP servers sit close to 100%, so read it with page life expectancy and file reads: it rarely drops even under memory pressure."
